  unitName: Pumpress Semira
  unitId: 860106
  unitNumber: 8045
  description: After Ciara's departure, Semira continued protecting the ancient sanctuary
    with the help of Jack, her savior. Honing her powers with Jack's guidance, she
    was able to take control of the captured mad knight's soul turning him into a
    guardian. There had been rumours that even evil forces dare not traverse into
    the sanctuary in fear or encountering Semira's wrath.
